### Get all checkouts - OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/checkouts
Accept: application/json

### Filter checkouts by ID - OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/checkouts/filter?fields=id&query=1
Accept: application/json

### Filter checkouts - OK (200) - no results
GET http://localhost:8080/api/checkouts/filter?fields=id&query=99999
Accept: application/json

### Filter checkouts - Bad Request (400) - blank query
GET http://localhost:8080/api/checkouts/filter?fields=id&query=
Accept: application/json
